{"version":1,"key":"card:769","content":{"id":769,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f63ad310-2a6a-47fb-957b-6d3ce2228f61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们通过 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":177,"contentId":171,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"56f978e0-a899-45fd-a08f-14ea242c891a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"context.drawImage"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将图片绘制到 canvas 上时，如果绘制的尺寸和实际的图片尺寸不同，就会产生缩放，此时可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"context.imageSmoothingEnabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来控制是否需要对图片进行平滑处理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3556b6e3-6d28-4d4f-b5ab-74eb130814ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"imageSmoothingEnabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个布尔值，默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示会对图片进行平滑处理，进行平滑处理后，缩放后的图片看起来会更加的柔和，比较适合照片、插图等场景。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e712f2dc-adda-4f02-a42a-204acbab7223","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"88baa7a1-da03-4ec2-9bee-213dc8a6bcf1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const canvas = document.querySelector(\"canvas\");\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n\nctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true;\nctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, 300, 300);","collabId":"109498d8-48b4-4a91-bc16-90bf64cfb9dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"87f72950-eac8-4e20-a9f0-01fef68ffef3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但有些场景，却不能进行平滑处理，比如我们的图片是像素风，如果对其进行平滑处理，反而会变得模糊，这个时候我们就需要手动将这个值设置为 false，以此来保持清晰的像素块效果"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"061e6b90-0cd6-400b-9269-f5e9df644ed0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"07da99b4-64b7-40d4-b5c0-a252d5aa2924","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = false;\nctx.drawImage(pixelImage, 0, 0, 160, 160);","collabId":"4d5ec9f8-a728-451e-993d-fccf979c4fb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9617e0d8-45d7-42f6-be53-35967ae75709","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一个相关字段 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"imageSmoothingQuality"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它是来控制平滑质量的，有三个可选值，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"medium"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"high"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，该值仅在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"imageSmoothingEnabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才有效果，另外该值只是一个提示，不同的浏览器和设备实际使用的插值算法和效果可能有所不同。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"3a7e403b-ca23-437c-9bf6-79a9add05049","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"643c690f-6b5b-437c-8ca0-45914d7d8302","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n\nconsole.log(ctx.imageSmoothingQuality); // \"low\"\n\nctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true;\nctx.imageSmoothingQuality = \"high\";\n\nctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, 500, 500);","collabId":"09673c86-a135-4af6-a540-296878efe7c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Canvas/imageSmoothingEnabled","Canvas/imageSmoothingQuality"],"createTime":1782653682357,"updateTime":1782654432853,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1782654432853},"links":{"card:177":{"key":"card:177","type":"card","id":177}}}